    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 20 68]\ntheorem babai_seress_conjecture :\n    ∃ C : ℕ,\n    ∀ (G : Type) [Group G] [Fintype G] [IsSimpleGroup G],\n    (∃ a b : G, a * b ≠ b * a) →\n    (groupDiam G : ℝ) ≤ (Real.log (Fintype.card G : ℝ)) ^ C",
